---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Photo from '../../components/Photo.astro';
import Faq from '../../components/Faq.astro';
import Cta from '../../components/Cta.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
import { areas, groups } from '../../data/areas';
import { services } from '../../data/services';
export const getStaticPaths = () => areas.map(area=>({ params:{slug:area.slug},props:{area} }));
const { area: a } = Astro.props;
const g = groups[a.group];
const relevant = services.filter(s => (g.services as readonly string[]).includes(s.slug));
const nearby = areas.filter(x=>x.group===a.group && x.slug!==a.slug);
const faqs = [{question:a.question,answer:a.answer},{question:`Can I call about an urgent blocked drain in ${a.name}?`,answer:`Yes. Call ${site.phone} 24/7 and explain any sewage overflow, affected fixtures and access concerns. We confirm the available response for the address. Stop using affected fixtures and keep clear of wastewater while waiting for advice.`},{question:`How do you decide which equipment to use in ${a.name}?`,answer:'We assess the pipe, symptoms and available entry points. Local fixture tools, professional water jetting and CCTV have different roles. If damage is found, suitable relining or replacement is discussed on the evidence, with additional work agreed before proceeding.'}];
---
<Layout title={`Blocked Drains ${a.name} | CCTV & Drain Clearing | Antons`} description={`Need blocked-drain help in ${a.name}? Antons offers diagnosis, clearing and repair options. Read local access advice, then call ${site.phone} to book.`} crumbs={[{name:'Service areas',href:'/service-areas'},{name:a.name,href:`/service-areas/${a.slug}`}]} schema={[{'@type':'Service',name:`Blocked drains ${a.name}`,serviceType:'Drain inspection, clearing and repair',provider:{'@id':`${site.url}/#business`},areaServed:{'@type':'Place',name:`${a.name}, NSW`},url:`${site.url}/service-areas/${a.slug}`}]}>
  <section class="wrap page-hero"><div><h1>Blocked drains<br /><span class="blue">{a.name}.</span></h1><p class="lead">A slow drain, repeated blockage or urgent overflow? Get a clear assessment and practical drainage help for your {a.name} property.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button call" href={site.tel}>Call {site.phone}</a><a class="text-link" href="#local-advice">Local booking advice</a></div><p class="fine">Mobile Northern Beaches service · NSW licence {site.licence}</p></div><figure><Photo name={g.image} alt="Real Antons team drainage work showing equipment or pipework used for inspection and repair" eager /><figcaption class="proof-caption">From the wider Antons job gallery: our drainage team and equipment at work.</figcaption></figure></section>
  <div class="wrap content-layout"><article class="reading"><section id="local-advice"><h2>Drainage help for {a.name} properties.</h2><p>{a.context}</p><p>{a.booking}</p></section><section><h2>{g.focus}.</h2><p>{g.text}</p></section><section><h2>From symptoms to a suitable fix.</h2><p>We start with the affected fixtures and the timing of the problem. One slow basin may point to a local waste obstruction; multiple fixtures backing up can point to a restriction farther along the sewer. A rain-only overflow needs the stormwater route considered separately.</p><p>CCTV helps identify accessible roots, joints and defects. A heavily obstructed pipe may need clearing before the camera can provide a useful view. The findings guide the next step, rather than the suburb name or the nearest visible tree.</p></section><section><h2>Professional equipment, chosen for the job.</h2><p>Suitable water-jetting nozzles and mechanical clearing tools can remove obstructions. A camera and, where appropriate, locating equipment help investigate recurring faults. We assess pipe material, access and condition before choosing a method.</p><p>When a structural repair is needed, options can include a compatible pipe section and fittings, or a selected liner system where the existing pipe is suitable. Excavation, bedding and surface reinstatement are discussed as part of the scope. Clearing alone cannot rebuild a collapsed pipe or seal an open joint.</p></section><section><h2>A useful first call from {a.name}.</h2><ul><li>Describe what is backing up and whether there is an active overflow.</li><li>Tell us when it began, what triggers it and whether it has happened before.</li><li>Share the access details above, plus any strata or business approval contact.</li><li>Ask about initial charges, the proposed scope and any footage or reporting you need.</li></ul><p>We explain the available response and agree the work before proceeding. An inspection may identify maintenance needs or a separately quoted repair; you will have the findings to discuss your options.</p></section></article><aside class="aside"><h2>Help in {a.name}.</h2><p>Tell us the address and what you are seeing. Urgent calls are welcome at any hour; timing and access are confirmed during booking.</p><a class="button call" href={site.tel}>{site.phone}</a>{relevant.map(s=><a href={`/services/${s.slug}`}>{s.name}</a>)}<a href="/drain-advice/blocked-drain-costs">Understand the cost factors</a><a href="/our-work">See our team’s work</a></aside></div>
  <section class="section related"><div class="wrap"><h2>Also serving: {g.name}.</h2><div class="related-links">{nearby.map(n=><a href={`/service-areas/${n.slug}`}>{n.name}</a>)}</div></div></section><Faq items={faqs} title={`Questions from ${a.name} customers.`} /><Cta />
</Layout>
